#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:2 9bbda214bb8542f083335ecc4ee704d6
msgid "AsyncHyperliquid"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:6 d2601955204640b1afed56514e437091
msgid ""
"This reference includes methods that place, modify, cancel, and close "
"orders; change leverage or margin; and move assets. A signature is not a "
"safety procedure. Before calling them, read :doc:`../howto/orders`, "
":doc:`../howto/routing`, :doc:`../howto/transfers-administration`, and "
":doc:`../howto/lifecycle-reconciliation`. Start on testnet and reconcile "
"every ambiguous signed outcome before replacement."
msgstr ""
"本参考包含下单、修改、取消和关闭订单，更改杠杆或保证金，以及转移资产的方法。签名并非安全流程。调用这些方法前，请阅读 "
":doc:`../howto/orders`、:doc:`../howto/routing`、:doc:`../howto/transfers-"
"administration` 和 :doc:`../howto/lifecycle-reconciliation`。请从 testnet "
"开始，并在替换前对每个含糊的已签名结果进行对账。"

#: 1213cdf5ddd44f5e9e9b5e3fd47d2b07 async_hyperliquid.client.AsyncHyperliquid:1
#: of
msgid "Resource owner plus intent-level order workflows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:17 4b80c5002a5c4320875b99fc092bd5ee
msgid ""
"Use the root client for workflows that resolve coins, metadata, prices, "
"token precision, or positions. Use ``.info`` for reads and ``.exchange`` "
"for the Info-independent actions listed in :doc:`exchange-client`."
msgstr ""
"对于需要解析币种、元数据、价格、token 精度或持仓的工作流，请使用 root client。使用 ``.info`` 进行读取，使用 "
"``.exchange`` 执行 :doc:`exchange-client` 中列出的独立于 Info 的操作。"

#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:22 714ca5b6e5c342d297004363cbab0ecd
msgid "Shared contract"
msgstr "共享契约"

#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:24 d3c956cd21da4acca3edb338b56a9243
msgid ""
"Use the client as an async context manager, or pair ``open()`` with "
"``close()``. The root client owns the shared HTTP transport."
msgstr "请将客户端用作 async 上下文管理器，或配对调用 ``open()`` 与 ``close()``。root client 拥有共享的 HTTP transport。"

#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:26 bd66b80751464de19aa7e05c24d518b5
msgid ""
"Public amounts, prices, and sizes are human-readable ``float`` values. "
"The client resolves venue metadata before encoding; consult "
":doc:`../howto/markets` for accepted coin names and precision behavior."
msgstr "公共数量、价格和 size 使用人类可读的 ``float`` 值。客户端会在编码前解析交易场所元数据；可接受的 coin 名称和精度行为请参见 :doc:`../howto/markets`。"

#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:29 e96eca8a58b24b9bb575a06535fb69bc
msgid ""
"Signed methods return a typed success-or-rejection union. ``status == "
"\"err\"`` is returned data, while local validation, transport, and "
"malformed-response failures raise exceptions. See :doc:`response-types` "
"and :doc:`errors`."
msgstr "签名方法返回带类型的成功或拒绝联合类型。``status == \"err\"`` 是返回数据，而本地验证、传输和响应格式错误会抛出异常。参见 :doc:`response-types` 和 :doc:`errors`。"

#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:32 d961e2d360a74cb5abdbe39730ff9f7a
msgid ""
"A timeout does not prove that a signed action failed. The client does not"
" retry signed actions automatically; reconcile through trusted Info reads"
" before replacement."
msgstr "超时不能证明签名操作失败。客户端不会自动重试签名操作；替换前请通过可信的 Info 查询核对状态。"

#: ../../reference/async-hyperliquid.rst:36 ea4b247661c5496b865b8e9221a2ac0d
msgid ""
"The method signatures below are the authoritative parameter and return-"
"type reference. The order and transfer guides define the required safety "
"procedure and response handling without repeating it under every method."
msgstr "下方方法签名是参数和返回类型的权威参考。订单与转账指南定义了必须遵循的安全流程和响应处理，无需在每个方法下重复。"
